      "cooked": "<p>I want to show product barcode as an image in the sales invoice print format as it is in the second row below.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/1/51e4e777d0e06e632ff7a0cbe56e238e627856fe.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/51e4e777d0e06e632ff7a0cbe56e238e627856fe\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/1/51e4e777d0e06e632ff7a0cbe56e238e627856fe.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"bGt6cwG5GcCQwmMjZ7YXh5B7imG\" width=\"291\" height=\"292\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">291×292 11.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Sometimes it does not show the barcode like third image, and sometimes it shows only the barcode code.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">&lt;td scope=\"row\"&gt;\n    {% set barcode_data = item.custom_basic_barcode or item.barcode or item.item_code %}\n    {% if item.custom_basic_barcode or item.barcode %}\n        &lt;img alt='Barcode' src='https://barcode.tec-it.com/barcode.ashx?data={{ barcode_data }}&amp;code=Code128&amp;translate-esc=on' style=\"max-height: 36px;min-width: 80px; width: fit-content !important;\" /&gt;\n    {% else %}\n        &lt;span style=\"display: inline-block; min-width: 80px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px;\"&gt;{{ item.item_code }}&lt;/span&gt;\n    {% endif %}\n&lt;/td&gt;\n</code></pre>",
